  "action": "deliver_reel",
  "words": "Here’s the last one. Don’t scrub it back and forth, Rita. Just run it through.",
  "intention": "Ensure Alma’s final recording reaches Rita before the station line closes, preserving the historical record despite the personal risk.",
  "detail": "I step away from the ballroom’s spectacle and walk directly to the open station line. I place the single charged reel into the transfer slot, watching the indicator light blink green to confirm the data is moving to Rita’s patch. I do not stay to watch the screen; I leave the lobby immediately, pulling my coat tighter against the February chill, and head toward the exit where the night air is already settling in."
